    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town hosts Old Sturbridge Village, a living history museum that recreates rural New England life from the 1790s to the 1830s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sturbridge%2C_Massachusetts"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Tantiusques, an open‑space reservation and historic site, was first visited by Puritans in 1644 and later mined for graphite, lead, and iron.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
